### Register: başarılı (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ali Veli", "email": "Ali@Example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Register: aynı e-posta, farklı harf (409 EMAIL_TAKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Baska Biri", "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Register: kısa şifre (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ayse", "email": "ayse@example.com", "password": "123" }

### Register: fazladan alan yok sayılmalı (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mehmet", "email": "mehmet@example.com", "password": "gizli12345", "emailVerifiedAt": "2020-01-01" }

### Register: başarılı (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ayşe demir", "email": "ayse2@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Verify: geçerli token (200)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "b8c5156c01bf2c39e7d0640f5940a91f1e5c2e7234fd16b5fa2869cdb525a8f9" }

### Verify: aynı token tekrar (400 INVALID_TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "b8c5156c01bf2c39e7d0640f5940a91f1e5c2e7234fd16b5fa2869cdb525a8f9" }

### Verify: uydurma token (400 INVALID_TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "abc123" }

### Resend: kayıtlı olmayan e-posta (200, aynı cevap)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "yok@example.com" }

### Resend: doğrulanmamış hesap (200, konsolda yeni link)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ayse2@example.com" }

### Login: doğrulanmamış hesap (403 EMAIL_NOT_VERIFIED)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mehmet@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Login: yanlış şifre (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "yanlis-sifre" }

### Login: olmayan e-posta (401, aynı mesaj)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "yok@example.com", "password": "yanlis-sifre" }

### Login: doğru bilgiler (200, accessToken döner)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Me: token ile (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Me: token yok (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Me: bozuk token (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi

### 1) Login: cevapta Set-Cookie başlığına bak, gövdede refreshToken olmamalı
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### 2) Refresh: yeni accessToken, yeni cookie (değeri değişmeli)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh

### 3) Refresh: tekrar (her seferinde yeni token, 200)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh

### 1) Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### 2) Logout (204, Set-Cookie ile cookie siliniyor)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout

### 3) Refresh: cookie yok (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh

### 4) Logout tekrar (yine 204, idempotent)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout

### Business: oluştur (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/businesses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Ali Berber", "slug": "ali-berber" }

### Business: aynı slug (409 SLUG_TAKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/businesses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Baska Berber", "slug": "ali-berber" }

### Business: geçersiz slug (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST http://localhost:3000/businesses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Test", "slug": "Ali Berber!" }

### Business: token yok (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/businesses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test", "slug": "test-isletme" }

### Business: listele (200, role: OWNER)
GET http://localhost:3000/businesses
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### İşletme listesi (ID buradan okunacak)
# @name myBusinesses
GET http://localhost:3000/businesses
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Detay, OWNER (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Ad değiştir, OWNER (200)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Ali Berber Salon" }

### Mehmet login
# @name loginMehmet
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mehmet@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Mehmet: detay (üye değil → 403, STAFF yapınca 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMehmet.response.body.accessToken}}

### Mehmet: ad değiştir (STAFF olsa bile 403)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMehmet.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Hack" }

### Uydurma ID (403)
GET http://localhost:3000/businesses/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}


### 1) Ali, Mehmet'i davet eder (201, konsolda link çıkar)
POST http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}/invites
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "email": "mehmet@example.com" }

### 2) Yanlış kişi kabul etmeye çalışır: Ali (400 INVALID_INVITE)
POST http://localhost:3000/invites/accept
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "token": "72b3cde9f42b51d5da5cb3f97c51c0504be8dbcb97bb986b361c392318937fdc" }

### 3) Mehmet kabul eder (200, role: STAFF)
POST http://localhost:3000/invites/accept
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMehmet.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "token": "2390b5dd3e2edf43894c148b15b82aa8a3b2eff1b5c0068caa8e797dc039f4ae" }

### 4) Aynı token tekrar (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/invites/accept
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMehmet.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "token": "72b3cde9f42b51d5da5cb3f97c51c0504be8dbcb97bb986b361c392318937fdc" }

### 5) Mehmet (STAFF) davet göndermeye çalışır (403)
POST http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}/invites
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMehmet.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "email": "biri@example.com" }

### 6) Ali, zaten üye olan Mehmet'i tekrar davet eder (409 ALREADY_MEMBER)
POST http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}/invites
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "email": "mehmet@example.com" }



### 1) Ali: üye listesi (200, 2 kişi: OWNER + STAFF)
# @name aliMembers
GET http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2) Mehmet kendi işletmesini açar (201, bir kez çalıştır)
# @name createMehmetBiz
POST http://localhost:3000/businesses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMehmet.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Mehmet Kuafor", "slug": "mehmet-kuafor" }

### 3) Ali, Mehmet'in işletmesinin üyelerine bakar (403, üye değil)
GET http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{createMehmetBiz.response.body.$.business.id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4) IDOR denemesi: Mehmet, KENDİ işletmesinin URL'si ile Ali'nin işletmesindeki üyeyi silmeye çalışır (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{createMehmetBiz.response.body.$.business.id}}/members/{{aliMembers.response.body.$.members[1].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMehmet.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5) Mehmet (Ali'nin işletmesinde STAFF) silmeye çalışır (403, OWNER değil)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}/members/{{aliMembers.response.body.$.members[1].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMehmet.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6) Ali, kendi OWNER üyeliğini silmeye çalışır (404, sadece STAFF silinebilir)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}/members/{{aliMembers.response.body.$.members[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7) Ali, Mehmet'i işletmesinden çıkarır (204)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}/members/{{aliMembers.response.body.$.members[1].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 8) Mehmet, eski token'ıyla Ali'nin işletmesine bakar (403, anında)
GET http://localhost:3000/businesses/{{myBusinesses.response.body.$.businesses[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMehmet.response.body.accessToken}}